---
// Services grid (6 cards). #services anchor preserved.
---

<section id="services" class="features section" aria-label="Services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-scroll-reveal>
      <span class="section-tag">What We Do</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-cs-title>Digital services built to <span class="gradient-text">drive growth</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">From your first pixel to your next 10,000 customers — we handle every layer of your digital presence.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="0">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Website Development</h3>
        <p>Custom, high-performance websites built for speed, conversion, and scale. From landing pages to full-stack web applications.</p>
        <div class="feature-tag">Core Service</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="100">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M2 12s4-8 10-8 10 8 10 8-4 8-10 8-10-8-10-8z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>UI/UX Design</h3>
        <p>Beautiful, intuitive interfaces that keep users engaged and convert visitors into loyal customers — effortlessly.</p>
        <div class="feature-tag">Design</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card feature-card-large" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="200">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l2.4 7.4H22l-6.2 4.5 2.4 7.4L12 17l-6.2 4.3 2.4-7.4L2 9.4h7.6z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Brand Identity</h3>
        <p>We craft brand identities that are unmistakable — logos, colour systems, typography, tone of voice, and complete visual guidelines that make your business impossible to ignore and impossible to forget.</p>
        <div class="feature-sparkle" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Core Service</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="0">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="M7 16l4-4 4 4 4-8"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>SEO &amp; Growth Strategy</h3>
        <p>Data-driven SEO and digital growth strategies that consistently put your business in front of the right audience at exactly the right moment.</p>
        <div class="feature-tag">Growth</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="100">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>E-Commerce Solutions</h3>
        <p>Conversion-optimised online stores built on Shopify, WooCommerce, or custom stacks — designed to sell around the clock.</p>
        <div class="feature-tag">Commerce</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="200">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.79 19.79 0 0 1 2.12 4.18 2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Digital Marketing</h3>
        <p>Social media, paid ads, email campaigns, and content marketing — aligned to your brand and tuned for consistent, compounding growth.</p>
        <div class="feature-tag">Marketing</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
